      "behavior": "DLEN-dependent per-lane accumulator starts at +/-infinity with lane0 replaced by seed. Active elements update matching lanes. Halving folds zero-extend selected upper chunks and update all lanes except last fold writes lane0 only. Every fold still contributes selected physical-chunk flags."
    },
    "vf_and_fs": {
