      "behavior": "VF extraction uses raw low FPR bits, no narrow NaN-box check. All five elaborated FPU decoder modules have wflags=0 on all11 VF forms; valid zero flags dirty FS even at VL0. VV VL0 does not execute or dirty FS; nonzero VL flags valid asserts if FSOff, including all-masked operations."
